gametitle=Grand Theft Auto Vice City USA v1.40 - FPS and Camera Mod
comment=Development build: On-foot, car, motorcycle, helicopter and Skimmer Orbit validated by user. On-foot first person awaiting live test.
comment=Select+R3 cycles Normal/Orbit/First person. Select alone cycles Orbit distance. First person currently applies on foot only.
comment=Includes Zeroable control-remapper compatibility through the sole shared input hook. Do not enable the original remapper hooks alongside this file.
[Cheats\Camera development - reserve 32 KiB]
description=FPS and Camera Mod prototype. Requires full boot with 32 KiB reservation; use memory-card saves. Includes existing Zeroable controls.
author=Camera mod development; original control remapper by Zeroable
